      <TableCell><a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/rest_api/objects/index#io-k8s-apimachinery-pkg-apis-meta-v1-Time"><code>Time</code></a></TableCell>
      <TableCell>TimeAdded represents the time at which the taint was added.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>value</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
