      <h2 id="_api_endpoints" class="group scroll-mt-20">API endpoints<a href="#_api_endpoints" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p>The following API endpoints are available:</p>
      <ul>
      <li>
      <code>/api/v1/nodes</code>
      <ul>
      <li><code>DELETE</code>: delete collection of Node</li>
      <li><code>GET</code>: list or watch objects of kind Node</li>
      <li><code>POST</code>: create a Node</li>
      </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
      <code>/api/v1/watch/nodes</code>
      <ul><li><code>GET</code>: watch individual changes to a list of Node. deprecated: use the 'watch' parameter with a list operation instead.</li></ul>
      </li>
      <li>
      <code>/api/v1/nodes/{"{"}name{"}"}</code>
      <ul>
      <li><code>DELETE</code>: delete a Node</li>
      <li><code>GET</code>: read the specified Node</li>
      <li><code>PATCH</code>: partially update the specified Node</li>
      <li><code>PUT</code>: replace the specified Node</li>
      </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
      <code>/api/v1/watch/nodes/{"{"}name{"}"}</code>
      <ul><li><code>GET</code>: watch changes to an object of kind Node. deprecated: use the 'watch' parameter with a list operation instead, filtered to a single item with the 'fieldSelector' parameter.</li></ul>
      </li>
      <li>
      <code>/api/v1/nodes/{"{"}name{"}"}/status</code>
      <ul>
      <li><code>GET</code>: read status of the specified Node</li>
      <li><code>PATCH</code>: partially update status of the specified Node</li>
      <li><code>PUT</code>: replace status of the specified Node</li>
      </ul>
      </li>
      </ul>
